# Electron artifacts live on GitHub's release CDN, which times out on this
# network even when the zip is cached (SHASUMS256.txt is re-fetched on every
# packaging run). This is exactly the Maven-mirror problem class from spec §3;
# when `nnb` exists the CLI should set this itself instead of a committed file.
electron_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron/
